use firn/responsibilities
use firn/tags

[creative-workstation, three-d-authoring-workflow, knowledge-authoring-workflow] is a Responsibility
[three-d-authoring, knowledge-authoring] is a Capability
[blender, obsidian] is a Software
interactive is a Criticality

whiterabbit has responsibility creative-workstation

creative-workstation depends on [three-d-authoring-workflow, knowledge-authoring-workflow]

three-d-authoring-workflow
  requires capability three-d-authoring
  requires software blender
  is realized in environment
  has criticality interactive

knowledge-authoring-workflow
  requires capability knowledge-authoring
  requires software obsidian
  is realized in environment
  has criticality interactive

blender
  provides capability three-d-authoring
  is realized by blender

obsidian
  provides capability knowledge-authoring
  is realized by obsidian
